Guides in this section will walk you through basic usage of SumUp APIs, which allow you to develop a custom integration in case SumUp integrations don't fully support your use case. To start testing SumUp APIs and tools you need to have a test account. You can create a test account in the Dashboard.

{% image alt="A screenshot of the account selection dropdown in the SumUp dashboard with the test account highlighted with red circle" src="/img/guides/test_acc.png" width="40%" /%}

SumUp provides SDKs for [PHP](https://github.com/sumup/sumup-ecom-php-sdk) and [Go](https://github.com/sumup/sumup-go).
